# Only compiler inputs enter the image build context. This also excludes .env,
# local audio, Git/worktrees, internal docs, skills, frontend builds and tests.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!crates/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
# Keep local secrets/instructions excluded even if placed below an allowed tree.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/AGENTS.md
**/README.md
**/target/
**/.local/
**/.git/
